{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000141837","approvedSymbol":"CACNA1A","functionDescriptions":["Voltage-sensitive calcium channels (VSCC) mediate the entry of calcium ions into excitable cells and are also involved in a variety of calcium-dependent processes, including muscle contraction, hormone or neurotransmitter release, gene expression, cell motility, cell division and cell death. The isoform alpha-1A gives rise to P and/or Q- type calcium currents. P/Q-type calcium channels belong to the 'high- voltage activated' (HVA) group and are specifically blocked by the spider omega-agatoxin-IVA (AC P54282) (By similarity). They are however insensitive to dihydropyridines (DHP). {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P54282, ECO:0000269|PubMed:10049321, ECO:0000269|PubMed:10753886, ECO:0000269|PubMed:11723274, ECO:0000269|PubMed:15293273, ECO:0000269|PubMed:19232643, ECO:0000269|PubMed:24836863, ECO:0000269|PubMed:26716990}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"O00555","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A087WW63","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GTG6","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GTI4","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GTN7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GTW2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GU74","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GU81","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GUE5","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GUM7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GUP3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GUS3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GVX1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1C7CYY9","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A384DVW2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A590UJK2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0AAQ5BGX1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0AAQ5BGX9","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"B5TYJ1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"I3L2V5","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"I3L391","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"K7EIF8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"K7EKF7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"K7EQ95","source":"unipr